# ============================================================

# Runtime / generated data
**/App_Data/
**/umbraco/Data/TEMP/
**/umbraco/Logs/
**/umbraco/medialibrary/
**/umbraco/models/
**/umbraco/cache/

# Media uploads
**/wwwroot/media/

# Umbraco backoffice (bundled at runtime for v9+)
**/wwwroot/umbraco/

